dbd wrote:
> but do unicorn horns have any greater change to poly into
> magic markers than any other tool does?

Unihorns are magic tools, so are magic markers. The chance of a magic
tool polymorphing into another magic tool is much higher than that of
a non-magic tool polymorphing into a magic tool.
So a unihorn has a higher chance of polymorphing into a marker than a
non-magic tool, but it has no higher chance than other magic tools.


